  "description": "Evil bosses and minions and stuff have taken over your space base!\n\nGear up and shoot down the enemies that have invaded each zone in this side-scrolling shooter and platformer. There's a boss at the end of each zone (because it's a video game) that will require the best of your abilities to defeat! Use everything at your disposal: your primary weapon, shields, a special attack, and more!\n\nAs the lone warrior tasked with this mission, can you save this space station from total destruction?\n\nFeatures:\n* 59 levels across 6 zones!\n* 6 dangerous bosses to defeat!\n* Arena Mode: defeat a set number of enemies before it's game over!\n* Upgrade your character with 12 special attacks and 6 unique enhancements!\n* Choose between 10 different character designs!\n* Retro-inspired graphics and music!",
